  "title": "Quick Currant Scones",
  "description": "Fancy currant scones can be ready in less than 1 hour by using the food processor to mix the dough.",
  "authors": [
    "wwwfunfamilydinnerscom"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:53:20-04:00",
